post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
kwin-canvas-passthrough: KWin loads the plugin at login, so log out and in
once. `kwin-canvas doctor` (or `kwin-canvas status`) tells whether it
answers. After a kwin upgrade, rebuild this package; `kwin-canvas doctor`
and the login check say when that is due.
MSG
}
post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}
